WEBVTT

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.560
<i>What the heck am I doing?</i>

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.570
<i>Was Kanon serious about taking a bath with me?</i>

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>She'll be here any moment now... naked...</i>

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:20.840
<i>No!</i>

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>I can't let myself think about her that way!</i>

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.660
<i>But I...</i>

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.440
Niiyan, I'm coming in!

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.940
You thought I was gonna be naked, didn't you?

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.230
Niiyan, you're such a perv!

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.700
How dare you toy with a gentleman's heart!

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.380
Take this!

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.720
I should've known!

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.470
We siblings really do think alike!

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.900
<i>The feelings for my sister that
bloomed in my heart that day.</i>

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.690
<i>Will I be able to keep them inside me?</i>

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:54.230
We've got a winner!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.910
Niiyan, I won!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.160
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.170
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:11.240
<i>That's what happened when
my sister, Maeda Kanon,</i>

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.100
<i>won a European vacation for two in a lucky draw.</i>

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.470
Hey, Niiyan.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.090
It'll be just the two of us for a while!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.840
...just the two of us for a while...

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.650
...just the two of us for a while...

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.480
...just the two of us for a while...

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:36.450
<i>Kanon suggested that our parents take the trip,
since they never had a honeymoon.</i>

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.620
They're all your favorites.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.270
Mom sure loves you a lot.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:44.670
What about Paparin giving you that camera?

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.730
And he still hasn't bought me new clothes yet!

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.850
Hey, how are the eggs?

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.420
The eggs are eggy.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:06.580
No... I mean, do they taste like Mamarin's eggs?

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.880
They're the same, right?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.500
Are they really?

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.520
Here. Open wide.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.360
Open wide!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:21.830
Well?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:22.650
They aren't.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.190
But they still taste great.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.850
It looks like we'll be having
hot weather for a while yet!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.720
I'm here with Appi for tomorrow's forecast!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:40.140
Tonight, a low-pressure system will move in,
forming a front over the Sea of Japan.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:46.540
This front will pass through the whole archipelago, resulting in rain across all of Japan.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.640
It might get heavy in some regions.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.060
No!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.880
Hey, I heard you two are by yourselves!

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.700
I'm so jealous!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.920
By ourselves?!

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.800
She's my sister! What are you implying?!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.380
You may be siblings,

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:17.960
but if you treat her as a photography subject, you may see her in a different light.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.750
You too, President Kudou?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.800
<i>I didn't notice it before, but she's all grown up now.</i>

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.220
<i>Even as her brother, I
have to admit she's gotten cute.</i>

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.400
Maeda-kun.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.980
Here to take pictures too?

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.070
Y-Yeah.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.720
Aren't we dedicated?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.120
Mind if I took a look?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.040
Sure. I hope they came out well.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.280
Hey, these are nice pictures.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.300
Would you mind if I took a look at yours too?

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:05.880
Sure. Go right ahead.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:11.280
They're all so good.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.120
I hope I can take pictures like these someday.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:21.230
I'm just trying to cheer on those
hardworking people with my camera.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.230
Come back in a hundred years!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.990
You've barely started photography!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:31.380
As if you could fully appreciate the beauty of Onee-sama's pictures!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.000
W-Well...

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.090
I don't care.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.370
I'm here for Onee-sama, anyway.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:43.880
Onee-sama, let's enter this beach volleyball tournament together!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:47.440
Again? How many times have I told you? No.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.120
Well, see you around, Maeda-kun.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.140
Wait!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.530
Hey, wait up!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.640
I told you!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:04.230
They're going to form a temporary idol unit to celebrate the movie premiere!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.580
I wanna audition—

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.280
I know, I know. Just calm down.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:16.560
That should do it for audition photos!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.930
We've got a lot of smiles in there.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.760
Wanna try a more mellow expression next?

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.920
Mellow?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.590
Like, something heartstopping.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.540
I don't know what to do for that.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.180
Why don't you try thinking about a crush?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.680
A crush?

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.650
Yeah, if you've got one.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.350
Okay. Just gimme a second.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.440
Um...

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:55.740
I love you.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.790
<i>Sh-She's got someone she loves?</i>

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.550
<i>Wh-Why am I so upset?</i>

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.120
Maeda-kun!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:16.540
Maeda-kun!

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:16.960
Maeda-kun!

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.810
Maeda-kun!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.740
What're you here for?!

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.360
Maybe you could return those mags of ours?

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.150
But that's just an excuse!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:29.740
Our true motive is to see Kanon-chan in nothing but an apron!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.110
Like hell she'd be dressed like that!

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:37.000
These mags, right?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.950
You knew where I hid them?!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.040
Thank you for looking out for Niiyan all this time.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.830
Did you see her in that apron?

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.840
It'll keep me pumping for a <i>long</i> time.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.160
Yeah.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.940
Yeah, okay.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.430
Any souvenir will do.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:07.190
Say hi to Dad for us.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:11.240
Dad got too excited on his first trip to Europe

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.610
and came down with a fever.
They'll be staying a little longer.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.620
Then it'll be just the two of us
for a little longer too!

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:21.360
...just the two of us for a little longer...

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.870
...just the two of us for a little longer...

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.170
...just the two of us for a little longer...

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.480
...just the two of us for a little longer...

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.320
<i>When I started high school,</i>

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:44.300
<i>Dad entrusted me with giving you
this album when the time was right.</i>

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:48.310
<i>This album is full of pictures of you as a kid.</i>

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.740
<i>You were too young back then to remember.</i>

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.340
<i>And...</i>

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:58.320
<i>You might not remember, but I gave you that bell.</i>

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:02.990
<i>You see, Kanon...</i>

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.900
<i>We're...</i>

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.270
Hey, leave some for us too!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.320
Huh? What?

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:27.760
The water, obviously!

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.980
I didn't drink <i>that</i> much!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:33.980
Niiyan?

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.760
I saw you and thought about asking if you wanted to go home together,

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.140
but then you ran off.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.960
Y-You'll catch a cold!

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.760
Kanon, we're going home!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.060
O-Okay!

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.620
It's such a tight fit!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.860
I told you to sit on the other end.

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:28.680
Was the tub always this small?!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.370
We just got bigger.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:35.580
Time sure does fly.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.920
Yeah.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.700
I hope we can stay close like this forever.

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:44.520
We can. I know it.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.680
Yeah, you're right.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:50.390
We'll be like this forever.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:58.290
<i>Maybe it's about time I told her...</i>

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.480
<i>that we're not blood related.</i>

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:07.410
<i>But if I do that, our relationship might change forever.</i>

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.110
You already have me, yet you...

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:21.260
You've got it all wrong!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:38.600
Morning.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.260
Morning!

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:41.320
Hey, Niiyan,

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.280
you're free this Sunday, right?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.780
How would you know if I'm free?

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.930
I don't have club activities that day, and it's summer,

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:51.010
so I kinda wanna go to the beach.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:52.520
The beach?

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:56.710
Okay?

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.300
Let's go to the beach!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.900
Niiyan, look.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.720
Oh, Maeda?

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.530
You here to snap photos too?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.210
Let us preserve these youthful memories together!

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.780
The more supporters, the better.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.640
I should thank you, so I will.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:56.490
Thank you for cheering us on.

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:58.260
It was a great match.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:02.530
I'm glad that Katsumi-san agreed to participate with you.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.510
But we lost in the second round.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.320
I'm so disappointed.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.540
Where's Katsumi-san?

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:11.330
Onee-sama is talking to her beloved at the moment.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:13.960
Oh, I see.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.630
Sorry to hear that Katsumi-san already has someone.

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:19.900
It's okay.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.710
I already knew that my feelings would never be requited.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:28.000
Just staying by Katsumi-oneesama's side is enough for me.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:29.800
Narita...

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:32.690
Oops, I've said too much.

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.820
Thanks again! I'll see you around.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.600
Staying by her side is enough...

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.020
I kinda know how she feels.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.060
Kanon...

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.020
What about you, Niiyan?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.220
Do you?

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.390
Well...

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.340
Papa!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.000
What's wrong? Are you lost?

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.200
Papa!

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:14.350
Don't worry. I can help you look for him.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.840
Will this girl's papa please come here?

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.490
Papa! Papa!

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:22.860
Hey, you keep calling for your papa. What about your mama?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.860
Um... Mama's a star in the sky.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.360
She turned into a star so she wouldn't be sick anymore.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.490
You mean she's...

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.580
Papa!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:35.960
Kanon!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.000
Papa!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.240
You had me so worried!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.780
Where did you go?

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.920
Um, you see, Bunny... Bunny got lost!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.310
It wasn't me!

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:49.220
I'm glad we could find your papa.

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:50.800
Yeah! Thank you!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.210
Wait...

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.400
Are you...

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.720
Kazuya!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.350
Mama?

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.820
You found Kanon-chan?

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.120
Yeah.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.700
She was crying over there.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:04.690
Oh, I see.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.740
Thank you.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.710
You just met your new sister!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.740
This might be the work of fate.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.360
Aren't you glad to get such a cute little sister?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.030
Little sister?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:20.000
Aren't you glad to get such a cool big brother?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.250
Big brother?

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.960
We'll be a family starting today.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.000
We'll all live together.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.270
This is the star castle!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:36.780
Star castle?

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:37.620
Yeah!

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.420
Mama lives in it.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.620
One day, I'll live in it too!

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:43.020
Sounds nice.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:45.690
K-Kanon.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:46.880
Hold out your hand.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.340
Put it on Bunny.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:53.980
If he ever gets lost again, I'll hear the bell and find him right away.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:54.820
Okay!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.280
Thank you, Onii-chan!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:17:00.110
I'll work hard at being a good big brother!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.930
I'll always protect you!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:03.710
Okay!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.600
I'll work hard at being a good little sister!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.360
All right!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.760
That's a promise!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.580
Yeah! A promise!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:13.180
Onii-chan, let's make a tunnel!

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.810
Castles have tunnels?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:24.420
<i>I promised to be a good big brother.</i>

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.680
<i>But I...</i>

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:28.990
Hey, Niiyan!

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:31.860
Let's make a tunnel.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.780
Castles have tunnels?

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.280
If we make one, the star castle—

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.420
Niiyan, you remember the star castle?

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:53.420
Wait, you just remembered?

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:57.180
No, I didn't <i>just</i> remember it.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.580
I've always remembered.

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.820
Really?!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:01.580
Yeah.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.430
But... You remember when you gave me that bell?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:08.490
Sorry, I've always remembered too.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.440
I remember everything that happened that day.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.940
I see.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:20.120
And you've loved me like a brother this whole time...

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.730
You're so nice, Niiyan.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.450
No, I...

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:30.440
Thanks for being my big brother.

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.260
I tried hard to be your little sister too.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:37.380
I mean, I promised here...

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.200
that I'd be your little sister.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.280
Kanon...

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:45.800
Even though I've always... always wanted to...

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:49.830
You wanted to bring it up?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.120
Yeah, but I couldn't bring myself to.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:57.880
Whenever I thought about how it might change our relationship forever...

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.220
I'd get so scared.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.720
It's the same for me.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:08.210
If only I could've worked up the courage to tell you sooner...

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:14.210
No, I'm already really happy that we can talk about it like this.

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.590
Me too.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:30.350
<i>And so, I decided to give Kanon
the album Dad had left with me.</i>

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.820
You promised Paparin?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.580
Sorry I didn't give it to you earlier.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:55.760
There are photos of your other mom too.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.730
Yeah.

00:19:57.980 --> 00:19:59.860
We look so alike.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.640
Albums are so wonderful.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:04.320
Photos can transcend time.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.520
Yeah.

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:11.040
Niiyan, I have something to give you too.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:11.480
Hm?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.860
My first love letter ever.

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.740
I want you to have it.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.060
It's kinda embarrassing to confess through a letter.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.370
I felt pretty shy writing it.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.120
Wait.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.540
I want you to read it after I graduate from high school.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:45.970
After that, I won't call you "Onii-chan" or "Niiyan," but by your first name.

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:48.630
All right.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:51.270
I'll hold onto it until then.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.370
I'm glad.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:58.230
Hang on, when I was taking pictures of you in the school courtyard, were you thinking of...

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.500
Yeah.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:04.030
You're my ideal guy.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:08.140
You've been protecting me ever since I was little.

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:11.940
That's why I looked at you straight in the eye...

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:13.040
and said I loved you.

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.770
You're so cute, Kanon.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:25.200
We're siblings so I couldn't say it before,

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:27.430
but I can say it now.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.710
You're cute.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.430
The cutest girl in the world.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:35.920
I'm so happy.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.440
I love you, Niiyan.

00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:51.000
I just saw Mama!

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.420
I gave it to him!

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:53.900
I did it!

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:55.960
I did a good job, right?

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:02.610
You gave me a heart attack!

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:04.080
Sorry.

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:33.020
<i>Do you believe in fate?</i>

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>Do you believe in destiny?</i>

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:37.540
<i>I'll always believe...</i>

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>in my destiny with you...</i>

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:43.040
<i>and in my bond with you.</i>
